diff --git a/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md b/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md
--- a/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md
+++ b/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.md
@@ -106,6 +106,8 @@
 
 For self-hosted Chat Completions endpoints, `thinkingTokenBudgetField` selects the reasoning-budget parameter, and `vllmPriority` sets an integer scheduler priority when the server enables priority scheduling. Template arguments accept `$var: thinking.budget`. `openai-responses` gateways can set `supportsMaxOutputTokens: false` to omit `max_output_tokens`; Azure and Codex transports ignore this shared compatibility field. These controls are opt-in; catalog-owned Anthropic effort and fallback capabilities are not configurable switches.
 
+Only models whose exact API is `openai-codex-responses` advertise `serviceTiers: ['priority']`. Per-call `serviceTier: 'priority'` uses pi-ai's public `onPayload` replacement hook to copy `service_tier` into the common SSE/WebSocket request body; `streamSimple` reasoning, auth, retry limits and cancellation remain unchanged. The public `onProviderStreamEvent` observer reads only raw terminal `response.done`, `response.completed` or `response.incomplete` response tiers before normalization. It publishes the bounded scalar only on a successful Harness finish, never raw events, request-derived guesses or stale observations. See the [shared contract](../llm/README.md#use-this-package). No provider-profile tier default is added.
+
 ### Change configuration at runtime
 
 Each operation captures the current `providers` Config reference. New or changed provider profiles are validated before form persistence; unchanged catalog failures remain editable. Route-set or retry-policy changes update registration atomically, preserving previous routes if another adapter owns a requested route.
diff --git a/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.zh.md b/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.zh.md
--- a/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.zh.md
+++ b/packages/llm/llm-pi-ai/README.zh.md
@@ -106,6 +106,8 @@
 
 对于自托管 Chat Completions 端点，`thinkingTokenBudgetField` 选择推理预算参数，`vllmPriority` 在服务端启用优先级调度时设置整数调度优先级。模板参数接受 `$var: thinking.budget`。`openai-responses` 网关可设置 `supportsMaxOutputTokens: false` 来省略 `max_output_tokens`；Azure 与 Codex 传输会忽略这个共享兼容字段。这些控制均需显式启用；目录拥有的 Anthropic effort 和回退能力不是可配置开关。
 
+只有精确 API 为 `openai-codex-responses` 的模型声明 `serviceTiers: ['priority']`。逐调用的 `serviceTier: 'priority'` 使用 pi-ai 公开的 `onPayload` 替换钩子，将 `service_tier` 复制到 SSE/WebSocket 共用的请求体；`streamSimple` 的推理、鉴权、重试限制和取消行为保持不变。公开的 `onProviderStreamEvent` 观察器只读取规范化之前原始终端 `response.done`、`response.completed` 或 `response.incomplete` 的响应 tier。只有成功的 Harness finish 会输出该有界标量；不会输出原始事件、根据请求推断的值或过期观察结果。参见[共享契约](../llm/README.zh.md#use-this-package)。不新增提供方 profile 的 tier 默认值。
+
 ### 运行时更改配置
 
 每次操作捕获当前 `providers` Config 引用。新增或修改的 provider 配置在表单持久化前验证；未更改的目录故障仍可编辑。路由集合或重试策略变化时原子更新注册；如果其他适配器已拥有所请求的路由，则保留先前路由。
